# The build cache. 1.3 GB, and it regenerates from source in about three minutes.
/target

# Windows and editor leftovers
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.pdb
.vscode/
.idea/

# Nothing personal can reach this repository by accident, and not because of a rule
# written here. The user's real expansions (.espanso/match/base.yml), their settings
# (.espanso-manager/settings.json) and espanso's own binaries all live one level ABOVE
# this folder — outside the repository, where git cannot see them at all. That is the
# whole reason the repository root is espanso-manager-src and not the portable folder.
# If you ever move this root upward, those three paths become the first thing to exclude.
